    "body": "The existing tests cover invalid range values but miss a few cases where the scan object itself is malformed. This adds three checks for when the scan object is not a string or object, when `desc` is missing, and when `range` has an invalid format. Each case verifies that the RPC returns the expected error (-8).\n",
